lines:
May: {0100:0}! Long time no see!{be01}
Oh? While I was visiting the hot springs,
you got the Lavaridge Gym Badge.{be01}
You must have caught good Pokémon...
No, I guess you raised some.{be01}
I guess it would be okay for you to
have this.

Brendan: {0100:0}, hey, it’s been a while.
How’s it going?{be01}
Hmm...
That’s a decent collection of Badges.{be01}
All right, then.
You may as well have this.

May: With those Go-Goggles, you’ll
have no trouble getting through the{be00}
desert near Route 111.{be01}
But, wow, {0100:0}...
Challenging Gyms...{be01}
You’re trying hard because you don’t
want to lose to me, I bet!{be01}
{0100:0}, I think I should challenge
your dad in Petalburg Gym.{be01}
{0100:0}, see you again!

Brendan: Keep those with you if you’re
planning on going into that desert near{be00}
Route 111.{be01}
There should be some Pokémon that
are exclusively desert-dwellers.{be00}
You might look around for those.{be01}
As for me...
I’m considering challenging Norman,{be00}
the Gym Leader of Petalburg.{be01}
Unlike you, {0100:0}, your dad looks like
he really is tough.{be01}
See you around!

I have here an Egg.{be01}
I’d hoped to hatch it by covering it in
hot sand by the hot springs.{be00}
But that doesn’t seem to be enough...{be01}
I’ve heard it would be best if it were
kept together with Pokémon and{be00}
carried about.{be01}
You are a Trainer, yes?
And your Pokémon radiate vitality.{be01}
So, what say you?
Will you take this Egg to hatch?

我们不断地汲取热水，
但温泉却从未干涸，{be01}
很神奇不是吗？{be01}
这些温泉都很接近活火山，
地下水脉被岩浆加热，{be00}
从地表冒出来，{be00}
就形成了温泉。

埋在沙里的感觉……
哎……{be01}
说不出的温暖美妙……{be01}
呃？呀！啊噢！{be01}
有宝可梦咬了我！

据说温泉可以放松
紧张的神经，{be00}
减轻身体的疲劳，{be00}
解决感情问题，{be00}
还能增加财运……
